# Machine external interrupt from the interrupt controller.
# Host setup preloads:
# - controller source 1 enabled and pending
# - mstatus.MIE and mie.MEIE enabled
# - mtvec = 0x20
# Handler claims and completes source 1, records x10 = 2, and returns with mret.
# Mainline resumes at PC 0, writes x1 = 5, then spins at PC 0x4.
# Expect x1 = 5, x10 = 2, mcause = interrupt 11, mepc = 0, pc = 0x4.
